office
========

The office module of the Tryton application platform.

Installing
----------

See INSTALL

Markdown attachment exports support fenced ``mermaid`` diagrams using
``mmdr>=0.3,<0.4`` and ``markdown-it-py>=3,<5``, as in nantic_connection.
Install these Python packages on the server. Diagrams are embedded as PNG
images in HTML, PDF, Microsoft Office and OpenDocument exports.


